+ mult=1
XMN2 net1 B GND GND sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=2 nf=1 ad=0.58 as=0.58 pd=4.58 ps=4.58 nrd=0.145 nrs=0.145 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
.ends

